+answer it; (2) does averaging independently-seeded models' standardized scores
+add the usual variance-reduction gain? Mechanism unchanged from it11; only the
+training seed varies (init + shuffle order). Per split, each seed's scores are
+standardized (monotone per split, so within-user order per seed is untouched)
